---
import { ArrowRight, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-800 via-indigo-700 to-indigo-900 p-8 sm:p-14 lg:p-20 text-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
      
      <!-- Fondo decorativo -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 bg-white/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl relative z-10">
        <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-200 bg-indigo-950/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full inline-block mb-4 border border-indigo-700/60">
          UVASOFT • Producto Oficial UVA ERP
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
          Lleva el control de tu empresa al siguiente nivel con UVA ERP
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-indigo-100 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Comienza tu prueba gratuita de 15 días hoy mismo. Conecta contabilidad, nómina, inventarios, cartera, CRM y los módulos específicos de tu sector sin enredos.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4 mb-8">
          <a
            href="#registro"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-white text-indigo-950 font-black text-sm hover:bg-indigo-50 transition shadow-lg group active:scale-95"
          >
            <span>Crear cuenta y probar 15 días gratis</span>
            <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-700 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="#precios"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-400 text-white font-bold text-sm hover:bg-indigo-800/40 transition"
          >
            Ver Planes y Módulos
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 text-xs text-indigo-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" />
            <span>Sin tarjeta de crédito requerida</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" />
            <span>Facturación DIAN 2025 garantizada</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" />
            <span>Acompañamiento técnico en Colombia</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
